THIRD-PARTY MARKS, ASSETS, AND ATTRIBUTIONS
================================================================================

1.  NYCU Arete Honors Program (百川學士學位學程) crest
    -----------------------------------------------------------------
    The Greek-temple-and-olive-wreath crest rendered procedurally in
    `themes/nycu-arete/` is a code interpretation of the official
    visual identity of the Arete Honors Program at National Yang Ming
    Chiao Tung University (NYCU). The crest itself remains the
    intellectual property of NYCU. This project uses the crest only
    in the cohort-reference instance for educational, non-commercial,
    graduation-memento purposes for NYCU Arete cohorts. Forks
    targeting other institutions MUST replace this theme with their
    own identity.

2.  Anthropic Claude Code "Buddy" feature
    -----------------------------------------------------------------
    The owl mascot rendering takes inspiration from the "owl" species
    (internal identifier IG8) found in the Anthropic Claude Code
    Buddy feature (April Fools 2026 release, npm package
    @anthropic-ai/claude-code). The original ASCII frames are not
    embedded in this firmware; the owl is independently drawn using
    procedural primitives. Reference to Anthropic / Claude is for
    homage and inspiration only; this project is not affiliated with
    or endorsed by Anthropic.

3.  M5Unified, M5GFX, LovyanGFX
    -----------------------------------------------------------------
    Hardware abstraction libraries from M5Stack and lovyan03,
    distributed under MIT and other compatible licenses. See each
    library's LICENSE file when installed via PlatformIO.

4.  efontTW, efontCN
    -----------------------------------------------------------------
    Embedded CJK fonts shipped with M5GFX, originally derived from the
    efont project (https://github.com/skkode/efont). Used in
    accordance with the efont license.

================================================================================
COHORT DATA & PHOTOS
================================================================================

When you fork this project for your own cohort:

  * Real student photos, audio recordings, and personal messages
    MUST NOT be committed to a public repository. Use the patterns
    in `.gitignore` (cohorts/*/personalization.h, /avatars/, /voice/).
  * Replace `themes/nycu-arete/` with your institution's own theme
    (see docs/creating-a-theme.md).
  * Rename `cohorts/nycu-arete-115/` to your own cohort identifier
    (see docs/creating-a-cohort.md).
